{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/465264-hunter-compact-idea-the-organic-resistance","id":465264,"title":"Hunter compact idea- The Organic Resistance","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-01T15:49:33-07:00","id":465264,"title":"Hunter compact idea- The Organic Resistance","content":"So potential interactions between Hunters and Geniuses have been discussed, and I was thinking about those when I had an idea for a Compact that could deal with the Inspired but works well with the various scifi elements of the nWoD. <br /> <br /> Basically, I'm thinking they came out of a number of reports over the years hinting at the existence of anomalous mechanical- it could involve Geniuses, but it could very well have emerged without them: a Manikin burning through his mask, a Sin-Eater using the Industrial Caul, a Demon changing form, an Unfleshed revealing itself, and so on. <br /> <br /> The Organic Resistance is a Compact that took these sightings and came to a somewhat misguided conclusion- that the world is secretly run by robots disguised as humans. As a result, they investigate any anomalous phenomena related to technology, spreading their findings and theories over the internet. <br /> <br /> While many Hunters end up seeing the supernatural everywhere, the Resistance tends to look for scientific explanations- not like the rational causes sought by Null Mysteriis, but science-fictional explanations that fit their beliefs in Illuminati cyborgs or aliens. A vampire sighting might be considered evidence of a killer android or a disguised reptilian, while a werewolf might be assumed to be an escaped bioweapon. <br /> <br /> A big inspiration was the current trend towards such theories among conspiracy theorists- if you check the &quot;technocracy&quot; or &quot;transhumanism&quot; tags on tumblr you can see a thriving subculture among conspiracy theorists focusing on the idea that the Illuminati wants to turn us all into cyborgs or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}